<title>USA: U.S. DAP and ammonia flat, tight ammonia supplies.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP and ammonia flat, tight ammonia supplies.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia values were unchanged Wednesday, cash dealers said.</p>
<p>Tight supplies of ammonia in the international market continued to offer support to prices, ammonia sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;I heard there's a partially filled vessel coming from Brazil (to the U.S.) and they can't find the ammonia to top it off,&quot; an ammonia source said.</p>
<p>				   Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185		     unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
